    "bbox": [
      66.46,
      720.03,
      525.31,
      762.34
    ],
    "text": "In D.A.Wanigaratne Vs Juwanis Appuhamy 65 N.L.R. 168, it was held that in an action rei-vindicatio the Plaintiff should set out his title",
